  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HR/IHL NGO Sec.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Denmark, the Netherlands, Sweden (lead donor) and Switzerland pool funds to support a joint mechanism in order to channel funds to human rights and international humanitarian law (HR/ IHL) organizations operating in Palestine. The overall objective of the program is to contribute to the effective realisation of adherence to HR/ IHL in Palestine and to influence the behaviour of the relevant duty bearers: Israel, Palestinian Authority in the West Bank, and the du facto Hamas government in Gaza.</narrative>
  </description>
